# 📦 Pallet Warehouse Management System

A Python application designed to manage pallet inventory, optimize storage workflows, and track warehouse stock—built with a strong focus on real-world practical logic.

---

## 💡 Background & Motivation

With **18 years of experience in long-haul freight transport and logistics** as well as a background as an **Industrial Mechanic**, I know firsthand how critical accurate inventory management, efficient space usage, and clear workflow tracking are in physical operations.

This project bridges my practical, real-world domain knowledge with software development. It translates daily operational challenges—such as handling **pallets** and standard storage structures—into clean, scalable Python logic.

---

## 🛠️ Features & Functions

* 📊 **Stock & Inventory Tracking:** Manage pallet stocks, locations, and status updates.
* 📦 **Displaypalette Support:** Specifically handles display palettes alongside standard pallet types.
* 🧮 **Logical & Analytical Workflows:** Simple and maintainable CLI routines for inventory calculation and data processing.
* ⚙️ **Practical Problem-Solving:** Designed around actual logistics and storage rules rather than abstract exercises.

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack & Tools

* **Language:** Python 3.x
* **IDE:** PyCharm
* **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

